{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "06f12be6-8449-8430-b551-6ccb517772b3",
  "created_at": "2026-02-04T13:34:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Brendan Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:31:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:31:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hello, Brendan Quinn here. I got a reminder notice in the mail for a water and sewer bill, and I never got the original bill. Never saw it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:31:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry about that. What's the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:31:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What? Say that again, I'm a little hard of hearing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:31:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The address for the service. Where's the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:31:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, 187 Bacheller Street. Fifth Ward. I've been here a long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:32:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, give me a second. Okay, I see it. Looks like the original bill was mailed to a different address, an older one on the account. That's why it never reached you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:32:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "An old address! Well, that's just great. Nobody told me. I only found out because the reminder came with the right address on it. Funny how that one found me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:32:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the reminders sometimes pull from a different record. I can update your mailing address while we're on the phone so the next one goes to the right place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:32:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do. Bacheller Street, one eighty-seven. Same as I said."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:32:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Done. Now, was the last bill based on an actual reading or an estimate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:32:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "An estimate? Probably. The meter's in the crawlspace and nobody goes in there. I sure don't. I'm not crawling around under the house at my age."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:32:53-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would explain it. When they can't get to the meter, it gets billed on an estimate until someone reads it. We can set up a visit or look at a remote reader if you want to ask about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:33:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe later. Right now I just want to pay this thing. Can I do it on the website with a card, right now, this late in the day? Or is it only during office hours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:33:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The website takes payments any time, day or night, weekends too. It's not tied to our office hours. You'd just need your account number from the notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:33:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Any time. Okay. And if I don't want to do that, there's something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:33:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a drop box at City Hall for checks, and it's out front, so you can use it when we're closed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:33:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'd rather do the card. My holiday bonus came in a lot smaller than I figured, so I'd like to get this off the books before anything else goes wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:33:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. If you pay it now, the reminder should clear out once it posts. It can take a day or two to show."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:34:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or two. Okay. And you changed the address for sure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:34:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes sir, it's updated. Next bill goes to 187 Bacheller."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:34:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, thank you, Tony. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:34:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Take care now."
    }
  ],
